completed: 2026-05-06

## Summary

Implemented milestone 017: Private API versioning (`/v1`), OpenAPI documentation via Swagger, typed response models, and UI updates.

### Backend changes

#### API Versioning (`internal/api/api.go`)
- All management routes moved under `/v1` using `app.Group("/v1")`.
- Added `github.com/gofiber/swagger` import and two unauthenticated routes:
  - `GET /v1/apidocs/*` — Swagger UI (interactive documentation)
  - `GET /v1/swagger.json` — raw OpenAPI 3.0 JSON spec
- Added main API info Swagger annotation block (`@title`, `@version`, `@description`, `@securityDefinitions`) documenting both `DigestAuth` and `BearerToken` security schemes.
- Imported `_ "github.com/gchiesa/drl/internal/api/docs"` (generated swagger docs package).

#### Models package (`internal/api/models/models.go`)
Created new `models` package with typed request/response structs replacing all `fiber.Map` and local anonymous structs:
- `ErrorResponse` — standardized error body `{error, code, details}`
- `StatusResponse` — cluster status
- `AccountingStatsResponse` — accounting statistics
- `BulkLoadLine` + `BulkLoadResponse` — bulk load request/response
- `EntityResponse` + `BlockedEntityEntry` — blocklist add/delete/list
- `GetTokenResponse` — bootstrap token issuance
- `UIMetricsResponse` — dashboard metrics snapshot

#### Handler annotations and model usage
- `handlers.go` — `handleStatus`: Swagger `@Router /status [get]`; returns `models.StatusResponse`.
- `handlers_accounting.go` — `handleAccountingLoad`: `@Router /accounting/load [post]`; uses `models.BulkLoadLine` / `models.BulkLoadResponse`. `handleAccountingStats`: `@Router /accounting/stats [get]`; returns `models.AccountingStatsResponse`.
- `handlers_blocklist.go` — `handleBlockEntityList/Add/Delete`: Swagger annotations; uses `models.BlockedEntityEntry` / `models.EntityResponse`.
- `handlers_config.go` — `handleGetStaticConfig`: Swagger annotation; returns `models.ErrorResponse` on errors.
- `ui_handlers.go` — `handleUIGetToken`/`handleUIMetrics`: Swagger annotations; return `models.GetTokenResponse` / `models.UIMetricsResponse`.

#### Proxy handler (`ui_handlers.go`)
- Updated allowlist to accept both `v1/` prefixed and legacy endpoint prefixes for cross-node proxying.

#### OpenAPI spec generation
- Added `swaggo/swag` v1.16.4 as a Go tool in `mise.toml`.
- `swag init --parseDependency --parseInternal -g internal/api/api.go -o internal/api/docs` generates `internal/api/docs/{docs.go,swagger.json,swagger.yaml}`.
- `swag init` step added to `ci/scripts/build.sh` before the Go binary build.

### Frontend changes

#### `ui/src/lib/auth.js`
- ECDH exchange endpoint updated: `/drl/ui/exchange` → `/v1/drl/ui/exchange`.

#### `ui/src/App.svelte`
- All `apiFetch` calls updated to `/v1/` prefix:
  - `/status` → `/v1/status`
  - `/blocked-entity` → `/v1/blocked-entity`
  - `/accounting/stats` → `/v1/accounting/stats`
  - `/drl/ui/api/metrics` → `/v1/drl/ui/api/metrics`
  - `/drl/ui/proxy/:addr/drl/ui/api/metrics` → `/v1/drl/ui/proxy/:addr/v1/drl/ui/api/metrics`
  - `/drl/ui/proxy/:addr/accounting/stats` → `/v1/drl/ui/proxy/:addr/v1/accounting/stats`
  - `/configuration/static/accounting` → `/v1/configuration/static/accounting`
  - `/configuration/static/membership` → `/v1/configuration/static/membership`
- Token modal curl hint updated to `/v1/drl/ui/get-token`.

### Documentation

#### `docs/content/docs/internal-api.md`
- All endpoint paths updated to `/v1/` prefix.
- Added OpenAPI documentation section with links to `/v1/apidocs/` and `/v1/swagger.json`.
- Added ECDH session auth section alongside Digest auth.
- Added standardized error response model section.

### Test updates
All test files updated to use `/v1/` routes and `models.*` types:
- `handlers_accounting_test.go` — `/v1/accounting/stats`, `models.AccountingStatsResponse`
- `handlers_accounting_load_test.go` — `/v1/accounting/load`, `models.BulkLoadResponse`
- `handlers_blocklist_test.go` — `/v1/blocked-entity`, `models.EntityResponse`, `models.BlockedEntityEntry`
- `api_test.go` — `/v1/status`
- `ui_test.go` — `/v1/status`, `/v1/drl/ui/*`, `models.UIMetricsResponse`, `models.GetTokenResponse`

### Test results
